  "id": 7952019062832,
  "title": "KONBRIT KBDM-150 High-Capacity Food Forming Machine | 1,000–12,000 pcs/h | For Factories & Central Kitchens",
  "body_html": "<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>SHIPPING WARNING: Professional industrial equipment. Standard shipping takes 7-15 business days. Please verify specifications before ordering.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>⚠️ Note: Please consult our customer service regarding shipping costs and customs duties for your specific region before placing an order.</strong></span></p>\n<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0682/1127/7872/files/logopng_59696d57-8b32-4a1e-ad87-8d3c8f3c85dd.png?v=1776172485\" alt=\"KONBRIT Logo\" style=\"max-width: 100% !important;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #002147; font-size: 28px; margin-top: 10px;\">Model 150 Industrial High-Capacity Dumpling Machine</h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #FF4500; font-weight: bold;\">Premium Central Kitchen Solution | 8,000 - 10,000 pcs/h Output</p>\n  </div>\n  <!-- RECOMMENDATION BLOCK START -->\n  <div style=\"border: 2px solid #002147; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 30px; background-color: #f0f7ff;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color: #002147; margin-top: 0; text-align: center;\">⚙️ Complete Your Production Line</h3>\n    <p style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Maximize efficiency by adding the essential upstream and downstream companions for your Forming Machine.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: center; background: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0682/1127/7872/files/H3acc34d3278e41c99a962b6aab2f1b2cm.jpg?v=1776830770\" style=\"width: 100% !important; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; height: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">Heavy-Duty Meat Grinder</h4>\n        <p style=\"color: #FF4500; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;\">From .00</p>\n        <a href=\"/products/konbrit-industrial-heavy-duty-meat-grinder-sausage-maker\" style=\"display: block; background: #002147; color: white; text-decoration: none; padding: 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;\">VIEW PREP MACHINE</a>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align: center; background: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0682/1127/7872/files/H0120a1cd5e914c3ab129471b2107aa2eM.jpg?v=1776830757\" style=\"width: 100% !important; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; height: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">3-Layer Food Warmer</h4>\n        <p style=\"color: #FF4500; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;\">From .00</p>\n        <a href=\"/products/konbrit-industrial-glass-3-layer-food-warmer-display-showcase\" style=\"display: block; background: #002147; color: white; text-decoration: none; padding: 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;\">VIEW DISPLAY CASE</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- RECOMMENDATION BLOCK END -->\n\n\n  <div style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; border-left: 5px solid #002147; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color: #002147; margin-top: 0;\">Industrial Excellence from a B2B Expert</h3>\n    <p>Founded by industry expert <strong>Ma Haichen</strong> (12 years of specialized B2B experience), <strong>KONBRIT</strong> delivers high-end intelligent food processing equipment for the global market. Our Model 150 series is our flagship high-capacity solution, specifically designed for large-scale restaurants, food processing plants, and central kitchens.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n    <p>The Model 150 is the upgraded high-capacity solution for large-scale commercial use. With enhanced roller-pressing tech and up to 10,000pcs/h output, it delivers unmatched efficiency and consistent production quality, outperforming standard 130-type machines in durability and speed.</p>\n    \n    <h3 style=\"color: #002147; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;\">Key Advantages</h3>\n    <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding-left: 0;\">\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n<strong>✅ Versatile Production:</strong> Easily switch between Dumplings, Wontons, Spring Rolls, Samosas, Empanadas, and Potstickers by simply changing the molds.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n<strong>✅ Precision Engineering:</strong> Upgraded frequency control system allows precise adjustment of wrapper thickness (0.5-3.0mm) and filling amount.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n<strong>✅ Authentic Texture:</strong> Uses upgraded roller pressing instead of screw-extrusion, preserving gluten elasticity for a chewy, handmade taste.</li>\n      <li style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n<strong>✅ High-Moisture Filling Support:</strong> The \"sheet-first, fill-later\" design handles chunky meat and vegetable fillings that screw-type machines cannot.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n    <h3>Professional Applications</h3>\n<p>Ideal for central kitchens, food factories, and large-scale catering.</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #002147; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n    <table style=\"width: 100% !important; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; background-color: #f9f9f9; font-size: 14px;\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">\n        <th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">Feature</th>\n        <th style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">Specifications</th>\n      </tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\">\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Max Productivity</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">8,000 - 10,000 pieces per hour</td>\n      </tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Power</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">1.8 kW (High Efficiency Motor)</td>\n      </tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\">\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Voltage</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">110V / 220V / 380V (Customizable)</td>\n      </tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Dough Thickness</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">0.5 - 3.0 mm (Adjustable)</td>\n      </tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #f9f9f9;\">\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Dimensions</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">1350 x 600 x 1000 mm</td>\n      </tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Machine Weight</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px; text-align: left;\">Approx. 180 kg (Industrial Grade)</td>\n      </tr>\n</table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color: #002147; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;\">Global Manufacturing Excellence</h3>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0682/1127/7872/files/ScreenShot_2026-04-15_172822_740.png?v=1776245329\" alt=\"KONBRIT Factory Team\" style=\"width: 100% !important; ; margin-top: 15px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; border-top: 3px solid #FF4500;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color: #002147; margin-top: 0;\">Ready to Scale Your Production?</h3>\n    <p>The KONBRIT Model 150 is the definitive choice for food factories requiring 24/7 reliability. Shipped in reinforced export packaging with a 1-year global warranty.</p>\n    <a href=\"/pages/contact\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #FF4500; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 30px; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px;\">REQUEST A CUSTOM QUOTE</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"konbrit-brand-story\" style=\"margin-top: 40px; padding: 25px; border: 1px solid #eee; background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 8px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"color: #002147; margin-top: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #002147; padding-bottom: 10px;\">The KONBRIT Advantage</h3>\n  <p style=\"line-height: 1.6; color: #444;\"><strong>12 Years of Export Excellence:</strong> With over a decade of dedicated experience, KONBRIT is a trusted leader in the global food processing machinery industry, serving B2B partners worldwide with precision and reliability.</p>\n  <p style=\"line-height: 1.6; color: #444;\"><strong>Factory-Direct Strength:</strong> Our direct-from-factory model allows us to provide industrial-grade equipment that meets the highest standards of durability and efficiency, ensuring the best value for your investment.</p>\n  <p style=\"line-height: 1.6; color: #444;\"><strong>Global Supply Chain:</strong> Our robust international network ensures the delivery of top-tier components and equipment, sourced and manufactured to meet demanding industrial standards.</p>\n  <p style=\"line-height: 1.6; color: #444;\"><strong>Professional After-Sales Support:</strong> We stand by our machines. KONBRIT provides comprehensive technical expertise and after-sales service to ensure your production line runs smoothly and efficiently.</p>\n</div>",
